                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f0106dc-007a-3b4c-97e3-f3f5516a4792",
                        "entry_id": "f9ad989e-7b28-3382-9184-c22fa9dd8c18",
                        "glosses": [
                            "männlicher Vorname"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5891d58-05c8-467f-bc4c-b2cd0debfebf",
                                "sense_id": "3f0106dc-007a-3b4c-97e3-f3f5516a4792",
                                "text": "„9.45 Uhr: Auf der Rettungswache Mitte werden Ludwig K. (43), Rettungsassistent, und Marcus L. (24), Rettungssanitäter, zu ihrem ersten Einsatz des Tages alarmiert.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3eee4d23-8d68-4976-8011-55367ed7aca4",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9ad989e-7b28-3382-9184-c22fa9dd8c18",
                        "source_sense_id": "3f0106dc-007a-3b4c-97e3-f3f5516a4792",
                        "source_sense_description": "männlicher Vorname",
                        "target_lang_word": "Marcus",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Marcus",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6fdbbb7-aa26-3ce3-a702-f6ab2a22657d",
                                        "entry_id": "c720c79c-9405-36eb-8814-4a38478ee8af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from Latin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5f11f99-6c34-403a-bd43-397d5f18ceb5",
                                                "sense_id": "c6fdbbb7-aa26-3ce3-a702-f6ab2a22657d",
                                                "text": "Aristarchus my fellow prisoner saluteth you, and Marcus sisters sonne to Barnabas, (touching whome yee receiued commandements; if he come vnto you, receiue him:) […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "940dba14-203e-409a-9ee5-7d56effad5cd",
                                                "sense_id": "c6fdbbb7-aa26-3ce3-a702-f6ab2a22657d",
                                                "text": "The two Marci, Livius Denter, and Æmilius, ſucceeding to the conſulſhip, war broke out again with the Æquans; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d46e81c4-9d01-4641-b80b-460f79ee03ed",
                                                "sense_id": "c6fdbbb7-aa26-3ce3-a702-f6ab2a22657d",
                                                "text": "But, as the historian said, there were many Marci in one Cæsar, so there are many Cains and Judases in the best of us all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b38a06c8-fcdb-4762-80f2-c1e9303e6828",
                                                "sense_id": "c6fdbbb7-aa26-3ce3-a702-f6ab2a22657d",
                                                "text": "At epig. 73.5 the question ‘quis Marcus?’ is much more sensible, because there could have been many Marci to choose amongst."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da221648-2546-4356-8d1f-95b21910399e",
                                                "sense_id": "c6fdbbb7-aa26-3ce3-a702-f6ab2a22657d",
                                                "text": "But 'Marcus?' – a strangely Latinate name for someone born in Sighthill. ('Aspirational mother, boss,' he said. 'Better than Titus.Or Sextus.')"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70f81b30-a695-48b4-9330-cab6f03b460b",
                                                "sense_id": "c6fdbbb7-aa26-3ce3-a702-f6ab2a22657d",
                                                "text": "Rubin wondered who Marcus was. It was a City name, but there were many Marcuses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7581fabc-4384-4728-8ec5-033e8d5bde02",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9ad989e-7b28-3382-9184-c22fa9dd8c18",
